// Workspace settings for THIS folder only (codespace-starter). Unlike the
// settings in .devcontainer/devcontainer.json, which apply to every folder
// in the Codespace — including the student's own repo — these apply only
// while codespace-starter is the open folder.
//
// Hide the maintainer plumbing from the Explorer so students see just
// .devcontainer and the files they might open (David, 2026-10-09):
//   - .github: the launcher-tests CI workflow.
//   - .devcontainer/tests: the script that workflow runs.
//   - .vscode: this file.
// Hidden, not deleted: CI still runs on every launcher change, and the
// folders still show on GitHub and in `ls -a`. If the setting were moved to
// devcontainer.json it would hide .github in students' own repos too.
{
  "files.exclude": {
    ".github": true,
    ".devcontainer/tests": true,
    ".vscode": true
  }
}
